{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:366ff385ef894f0ec5d8a87e20bb6e1bbba0a880e25639d9773de90daebab117",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0908d28920fe431522597fd52cb79724a75009efcac4558be324228fbc01a6b",
      "text": "传递期待的作战会议",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41477469d74dd863576d76caf08514abd983d90661d43782956c9a06e38b400",
      "text": "同胞们啊！面向盛大的黑暗宴席，\n让我们开启圆桌会议吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50caa3b2e82cfef0c818783cd5b9784254e3b8a3238b74fb308631d213dd94b3",
      "text": "好的。全员都到齐了，\n赶快商量起来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d42e9783981e0fde5650b88f5292ddbe632266dc92aa4d05ec2ebed8d3167da",
      "text": "演唱会当天拍下视频，然后上传到\n官方频道对吧？听起来超级好玩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce21b6ff29fe08047f116722279c50ec35d604542dca5f1f1b1ea2f7983402a2",
      "text": "嗯。拍摄的内容由我们决定就好，\n有什么想做的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa1d7a51a2a709078d426c3098bf15529237fe84e4e1be73b48567d89d3c0aab",
      "text": "回看视频的时候，要是能让人回想起演唱会当天那份\n兴奋期待的心情就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f618cb4c05726047a92491852b5e32681c0bd2a69f54bbd416c80207d13b13",
      "text": "对了！那开演前，直接突击大家的休息室\n怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f47fa11568173483a504214ea6d0c4e08ba99db3a46469037bc5cf47ece474",
      "text": "虽然可能会稍微手忙脚乱一些，但把那副景象也拍进去，\n或许很有临场感，挺不错的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8664d20d93aad868602f284d2c35f8cf236883b5f77b3447d6200d06027d9dd2",
      "text": "也就是说，要将恶之仆从们挑战试炼的身姿毫无保留地\n展现出来是吧。库库……不错……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6d740465a051dbce11cbb159949bd3d252ad18a9d5ac9d05a2ec446bc30531",
      "text": "一个个轮着去会花很多时间，\n不如由我们5个人分头去拜访怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7a0b4656e615d48b5e05d4347eb366c3dcf8d2d07c45b8e67ca0804ad9a7f4",
      "text": "我觉得那样很好。谁去哪个组合的\n休息室，正式开演前先把分工定下来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2d0cff333f4bd867238ec79ff664234867fd5db8f6625c81ba84fe57470221c",
      "text": "那もふもふえん就交给我去突击吧♪\n一定要好好拍下他们穿上服装的样子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a5ee94a6fd0a077fa2f1e5cf64c4ff8ed50b86bdc50bcd1bdbd1d1645179f66",
      "text": "前阵子还一起商量过服装的事呢。\n确实可能会是一次不错的采访。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_011_22_5_06_011_22:5_06_011_22:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:124de5a3767ab21d9ac4f66e5ae1775c0b12b904899f125dfe8c0f22a3790a57",
      "text": "那么，分工一旦确定，就请制作人\n向大家转达这项企划吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
